folder_missing:
The games folder cannot be found:
{folder}
Set it in "Settings", then start KentoGo again.

notice_settings_broken:
The settings file cannot be read, so KentoGo started with the default settings.
Saving on the settings screen makes the settings file again.

Reason: {reason}

notice_history_failed:
The record of answers (history) cannot be opened. Answers are not recorded this time, and no reviews are asked.

File: {path}
Reason: {reason}

notice_cache_failed:
The problem cache cannot be used, so all games are read at every start (this takes time).

File: {path}
Reason: {reason}

notice_katago_failed:
KataGo could not be started. Losses of moves that are not in the game record cannot be judged.
Check the KataGo settings on the settings screen.

Reason: {reason}

notice_compare_failed:
KataGo could not be started with the comparison model. Its sequences are not shown.
Check the comparison model on the settings screen.

Reason: {reason}
